### Found (first MISS, then HIT)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/airports/KJFK
X-Request-Id: demo-1

### Lower case is accepted
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/airports/egll

### Unknown code: 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/airports/ZZZZ

### Invalid code: 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/airports/KJ%2A

### Readiness (Docker: management port, localhost only)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/actuator/health/readiness

### Health with Redis and upstream circuit details
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/actuator/health

### Metrics
GET http://127.0.0.1:8081/actuator/prometheus
